# IPFS videos directory
IPFS/videos/

# videos/ — the media never lands in the repo (it is pulled from IPFS), but the
# metadata that describes it must travel with the repo. Use "videos/*" rather
# than "videos/" so the negations below can re-include named files; git will not
# re-include anything inside a directory that is itself excluded.
# videos.yaml is the video evidence hierarchy, the counterpart of
# images/images.yaml. Add a new negation here rather than force-adding by hand.
videos/*
!videos/.gitignore
!videos/videos.yaml
!videos/manifest.yaml
!videos/videos.md

